  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="29.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 29.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa ream gehyre ⁊ hine forsitte, gylde ðæs cynges oferhyrnysse oððe hine be fullan geladige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone hears the hue and cry and neglects it, he shall pay the fine for insubordination to the king, or clear himself by the full oath.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hwa hream gehyre ⁊ hine forsitte, gylde þæs cingces oferhyrnesse oððe hine be fullan geladige.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
